shboard, KeyPointsPanel\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Report Tabs** (src/components/report/tabs/):\n     - OverviewTab.tsx: Stats grid, warnings, insights, recommendations, gaps display\n     - FindingsTab.tsx: Expandable finding cards with filtering, sorting, source linking\n     - SourcesTab.tsx: Credibility distribution bar, table view with SourceRow\n     - EntitiesTab.tsx: Entity grouping by type (person, org, location, event)\n     - AnalysisTab.tsx: Contradictions, gaps, causal chains with expandable cards\n     - PerspectivesTab.tsx: Perspective selector with detailed analysis panels\n   \n   - **Report Theming & Cards**:\n     - ThemedCards.tsx: ThemedStatCard, ThemedSection, ThemedBadge with radar/swiss variants\n     - ThemeContext.tsx: ReportThemeProvider, useReportTheme(), themeStyles object\n     - AnimatedNumber.tsx: AnimatedNumber, AnimatedProgressRing, PulsingDot\n     - Badges.tsx: TypeBadge, SourceTypeBadge, ConfidenceBadge, CredibilityBadge, PriorityBadge, StatusBadge\n     - ProgressBar.tsx: ProgressBar, MiniChart, ConfidenceDistribution\n   \n   - **Report Views** (src/components/report/views/):\n     - OverviewView.tsx: Video/static toggle, IntelDashboard, KeyPointsPanel, ConfidenceHeatmap, Timeline\n     - FindingsView.tsx: Sortable table with expandable rows, SortHeader component\n     - SourcesView.tsx: Cards/Network/Radar view modes, SourceNetwork, TrustRadar visualizations\n     - AnalysisView.tsx: Tab navigation (contradictions/gaps/chains), CausalFlow, ContradictionMatrix\n     - EntitiesView.tsx: Constellation/cards views, FilterChip, EntityConstellation visualization\n     - PerspectivesView.tsx: Perspective buttons with gradient colors, expandable detail panels\n   \n   - **Report Shell & Navigation**:\n     - ReportShell.tsx: Fixed modal with RadarAmbience effects, escape key handling\n     - ReportView.tsx: Main container with ThemedSidebar, Toolbar, tab routing\n     - ThemedSidebar.tsx: RadarSidebar and SwissSidebar with